{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Seven altars.</b> There are deep secrets; none will understand them but those who count, and the seventh in days and in months and in years, and seven lambs of the burnt offering and seven goat-sprinklings, and also HaShem said to Job: take for yourselves seven bulls and seven rams, and give complete for complete, then a spirit of understanding will be renewed. And the discerning will understand."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:19:02.627161624Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}